# Compiled binary. The module path and the binary share the name, so a plain
# `go build` from the repo root drops it here.
/lights-out

# Test and coverage output (Phase 8).
*.out
coverage.html

# Local credentials. The factory reads GITHUB_TOKEN from the environment; it
# must never be committed.
.env
.env.*
# The template is the one exception: it carries placeholders instead of a
# secret, and it is the only tracked description of the expected keys. Without
# this negation the rule above would silently hide it from the repository.
!.env.example

# Generated agent-tooling metadata (skill registry and its cache). Machine-local
# and regenerated on demand; not project source.
.atl/